      "source_text": "import TGLExt.V351InverseLimitFiniteMinorants\nopen TGLExt TGLV350.Regular TGLV351\nopen scoped ENNReal\nexample (P : SiteProfile) : ∀ X : PositiveCoreInput P,\n    scalarInverseLimitWeight P X =\n      ⨆ (Y : PositiveCoreInput P) (_ : Y ≤ X)\n        (_ : scalarInverseLimitWeight P Y < ⊤), scalarInverseLimitWeight P Y :=\n  scalarInverseLimitWeight_finite_minorants P\n",
      "stream_text": "C:\\IALD\\Central de Patentes\\Chatgpt\\TETELESTAI_V351_FECHO_MATEMATICO\\RETOMADA_A1B_012\\probes\\BadFiniteMinorantsTraceRemoved.lean:8:2: error: Type mismatch\n  scalarInverseLimitWeight_finite_minorants P\nhas type\n  (∀ (a : ↥(regularCoreAlgebra P).toStarSubalgebra),\n      scalarInverseLimitWeight P (positiveSquare P a) = scalarInverseLimitWeight P (positiveSquare P (star a))) →\n    ∀ (X : PositiveCoreInput P),\n      scalarInverseLimitWeight P X =\n        ⨆ Y, ⨆ (_ : Y ≤ X), ⨆ (_ : scalarInverseLimitWeight P Y < ∞), scalarInverseLimitWeight P Y\nbut is expected to have type\n  ∀ (X : PositiveCoreInput P),\n    scalarInverseLimitWeight P X =\n      ⨆ Y, ⨆ (_ : Y ≤ X), ⨆ (_ : scalarInverseLimitWeight P Y < ∞), scalarInverseLimitWeight P Y\n"
